  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The operations consist of the use of '79 Abbotsbury Road, Morden, SM4 5JY' as a small House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) under C4 Use Class, in that the residential unit is used by three to six unrelated people. The development constitutes permitted development within the meaning of Class L, of Part 3 of Schedule 2 to the Town & Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) \"the Order\" and would comply with the development tolerances set out in said Class L. The operation would therefore have been granted planning permission by Article 3 of the Order.",
    "Condition : 2 - INFORMATIVE\nThe applicant is reminded that the certificate applies to the use of the property for a 4 persons HMO for 4b4p. Should the occupancy exceed 6 persons, planning permission should be sought.",
    "Condition : 3 - INFORMATIVE\nThe applicant is reminded that properties of 5 or more persons require a HMO License from the Council as per the Housing Act 2004 Part 2. See more information at: Licensing of houses in multiple occupation | Merton Council."
  ],
